{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>I will say</b> to YHWH — it means \"on account of,\" as in \"Pharaoh said to the children of Israel.\" Its meaning is: say on account of YHWH, that He is my refuge and my fortress, and He is my Elohim in whom I trust. And the sense is joined, for it is as though he says: I have tested this, and I will be your guarantor."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 91, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:36:51.840962090Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}